/Title (Conclusion  The Employee Attendance Dashboard was successfully developed and optimized using  React best practices. The application demonstrates centralized state management through Context API, efficient rendering using React.memo and useMemo, lifecycle handling using useEffect, and improved performance through React's Virtual DOM architecture. The project strengthened understanding of React component architecture, state flow, and performance optimization techniques.)
